{"id":"westen","lemma":"Westen","pos":"noun","rank":1664,"glosses":["west","The area of Western Germany, i.e. those territories which were never part of the GDR."],"ipa":"/ˈvɛstən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/95/De-Westen.ogg/De-Westen.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Westens"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir gehen nach Westen.","en":"We're going west.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566151","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},{"g":"after / to"},null]},{"text":"Die Sonne geht im Westen unter.","en":"The sun sets in the west.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a sun"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"under"}]},{"text":"Sie waren nach Westen unterwegs.","en":"They headed westward.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"after / to"},null,{"g":"on one’s way"}]},{"text":"Wir fahren gen Westen.","en":"We're heading west.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go at speed"},null,null]},{"text":"Der Wind weht von Westen her.","en":"The wind is blowing from the west.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"wind"},{"g":"to blow","l":"wehen"},{"g":"from / of"},null,{"g":"hither"}]}]}